'''LMFAO''' was an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. LMFAO was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.
== Appearance ==
Its blade is light green with "#LMFAO" imprinted on it in blue, hence the name. The guard is lime green, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had the writing removed from its blade and was renamed [[Envy]].
*This, along with every other knife in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all player's [[Inventory|inventories]].
* The texture of the knife was made by Rdite as a knife submission for ''Murder''.<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/160971237/Knife</ref>
* LMFAO stands for Laughing my f*cking a*s out.
** It is unknown how this got past Roblox’s moderation, especially since they are very strict on small things.

